        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4.5\" x 4.5\" Square Corners Stainless Steel Spring Hinges, Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4.5 x 4.5 Stainless Steel Spring Hinges comes packaged complete with two (2) single action stainless steel spring door hinges, tension adjusting allen wrench, locking set screws, plus the mounting hardware. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). The included set screw is used to lock the spring tension after it is set to the desired closing force. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH45-specifications.gif?v=1704354589\" width=\"600\" height=\"298\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-DSH4545-630 Stainless Steel Spring Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-DSH4545-630 Stainless Steel Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.120\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Machine Screws: #12 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair, Two (2) spring door hinges.</i>\r\n</p>",
